<p>Enhance your mental attacks with a single gesture. You gain <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">+2, +4, +6, +8, +10</acronym> mindpower and <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">+1%, +2%, +3%, +4%, +6%</acronym> chance to inflict critical damage with mind-based attacks (current chance is <acronym class="stat-variable" title="Values for<br>Strength 10, 25, 50, 75, 100,<br>Cunning 10, 25, 50, 75, 100,<br>Luck 10, 25, 50, 75, 100,<br>physical power 10, 25, 50, 75, 100">0%, 0%, 13%, 28%, 43%</acronym>).</p><p>Requires two free or mindstar-equipped hands; does not require Gesture of Pain to be sustained.</p>